WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,060 --> 00:00:04,060
Baby, you just promised mom not to cry.

2
00:00:04,060 --> 00:00:06,670
Baby stops crying

3
00:00:06,670 --> 00:00:09,670
Baby is well behaved

4
00:00:10,670 --> 00:00:15,140
Rainbow Dash, stop crying. Rainbow Dash is the best.

5
00:00:15,140 --> 00:00:17,140
Mom, baby, good baby

6
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:19,140
The baby cries a little

7
00:00:20,390 --> 00:00:22,390
Identification results take time

8
00:00:22,390 --> 00:00:23,390
Get a room next to the hospital

9
00:00:23,390 --> 00:00:25,390
You and Rainbow Dash can both rest.

10
00:00:25,390 --> 00:00:26,390
The hospital general room is uncomfortable

11
00:00:26,390 --> 00:00:28,390
Who wants to book a room with you?

12
00:00:28,390 --> 00:00:29,390
Right in the hospital

13
00:00:29,390 --> 00:00:30,390
We are far away

14
00:00:30,390 --> 00:00:32,390
I'm just not sure what your father is secretly doing in the hospital.

15
00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:34,580
This is how I look to you now

16
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:38,580
What kind of good thing can a person who secretly kisses others be?

17
00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:40,580
I'm not a good person

18
00:00:40,580 --> 00:00:42,580
You still have a baby with me?

19
00:00:42,580 --> 00:00:45,990
Yes, it's Rainbow Dash

20
00:00:45,990 --> 00:00:46,990
I was born with you

21
00:00:51,130 --> 00:00:53,760
Open the door

22
00:00:53,760 --> 00:01:08,430
Leave him alone baby

23
00:01:08,430 --> 00:01:10,430
Mom and dad are here. Don’t cry.

24
00:01:10,430 --> 00:01:11,460
The results haven't come out yet
